{"study_accession":"PRJNA1065887","secondary_study_accession":"","study_alias":"PRJNA1065887","study_title":"Gene expression of myeloma cell lines with miR-7 transduction","study_description":"Gene expression of myeloma cell lines (MM.1S and KMS-11) transiently transduced with miR-7 and cultured for 48 h. Overall design: We performed comprehensive gene expression analysis on the miR-7-5p transduced MM.1S and KMS-11 myeloma cell lines and extracted several genes that have decreased expression by miR-7-5p","tax_id":"9606","scientific_name":"Homo sapiens","first_public":"2024-02-01"}
